Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:21:26 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add upcoming and past events tabs

Event::upcoming() and Event::past() compare starts_on with today in SQL,
ordered by date. ?scope= is validated against a closed list and the tabs
are not paginated.
